                "A": "z(1 - 0.3⁴ z⁻⁴)/(z - 0.3)（|z| > 0.3）",
                "B": "(1 - 0.3⁴ z⁻⁴)/(z - 0.3)（|z| > 0.3）",
                "C": "z(1 + 0.3⁴ z⁻⁴)/(z - 0.3)（|z| > 0.3）",
                "D": "(1 + 0.3⁴ z⁻⁴)/(z - 0.3)（|z| > 0.3）"
            },
            "images": {
                "title": "",
                "A": "",
                "B": "",
                "C": "",
                "D": ""
            },
            "answer": "A",
            "analysis": "Z[(0.3)^n u(n)] = z/(z - 0.3)（|z| > 0.3），Z[(0.3)^n u(n - 4)] = 0.3⁴ z⁻⁴ × z/(z - 0.3) = 0.3⁴/(z³(z - 0.3))。因此 X(z) = z/(z - 0.3) - 0.3⁴/(z³(z - 0.3)) = z(1 - 0.3⁴ z⁻⁴)/(z - 0.3)，收敛域 |z| > 0.3，A 正确。",
            "DifficultyLevel": 0.6548,
            "key": "text_1732335707890_r7xv7j"
