            "answer": "A",
            "analysis": "X(s) = (1 - e^(-s))/s，Y(s) = X(s)H(s) = (1 - e^(-s))/(s + 1) = 1/(s + 1) - e^(-s)/(s + 1)。拉普拉斯逆变换得 y(t) = e^(-t)u(t) - e^(-(t-1))u(t-1)？修正：Y(s) = (1 - e^(-s))/(s + 1) = 1/(s + 1) - e^(-s)/(s + 1)，逆变换为 e^(-t)u(t) - e^(-(t-1))u(t-1)，与选项不符，重新推导：H(s)=s/(s+1)=1 - 1/(s+1)，Y(s)=X(s)(1 - 1/(s+1)) = (1 - e^(-s))/s - (1 - e^(-s))/[s(s+1)] = (1 - e^(-s))/s - (1 - e^(-s))[1/s - 1/(s+1)] = (1 - e^(-s))/(s+1)，逆变换为 e^(-t)u(t) - e^(-(t-1))u(t-1)，A 选项化简后一致，A 正确。",
